        {"q": "What is CIDR notation?", "options": ["A dynamic routing protocol that automatically updates routing tables across networks", "A method of expressing subnet masks as a prefix length appended to the IP address", "A type of NAT that translates private IP addresses to public addresses at the border", "An IPv6 addressing scheme that replaces the older classful IPv4 addressing system"], "answer": "A method of expressing subnet masks as a prefix length appended to the IP address"},
