        {"q": "What is the purpose of inter-VLAN routing?", "options": ["To block all traffic between VLANs and enforce strict network segmentation policies", "To allow traffic between VLANs using a router or Layer 3 switch as the gateway", "To tag frames on trunk ports so switches know which VLAN each frame belongs to", "To assign IP addresses dynamically to devices connecting to different VLANs"], "answer": "To allow traffic between VLANs using a router or Layer 3 switch as the gateway"},
